    "Description": "For details on how to apply this update, which includes the changes\ndescribed in this advisory, refer to: https://access.redhat.com/articles/11258\n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\n* goose: Arbitrary command execution via malicious Git configuration\nin `goose review` (CVE-2026-72718)\n\n* goose: RMCP: Token impersonation via missing OAuth resource field\nvalidation (CVE-2026-63127)\n\n* goose: RMCP: Denial of Service via unauthenticated session table\nleak (CVE-2026-63128)\n\n* goose: rustls-webpki: Denial of Service via crafted Certificate\nRevocation List (CVE-2026-93599)\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact,\na CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer\nto the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.",
